{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LEV","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"利未记","commonName":"利未记","title":"利未记","order":3,"numberOfChapters":27,"sha256":"99d9beb158820300746e3672c3d2089e04f5e3bf87009a6b1798d024d009597c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/LEV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":27,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/LEV/27.json","totalNumberOfVerses":858},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["产妇洁净礼的条例"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你晓谕以色列人说：若有妇人怀孕生男孩，她就不洁净七天，像在月经污秽的日子不洁净一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["第八天，要给婴孩行割礼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["妇人在产血不洁之中，要家居三十三天。她洁净的日子未满，不可摸圣物，也不可进入圣所。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["她若生女孩，就不洁净两个七天，像污秽的时候一样，要在产血不洁之中，家居六十六天。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「满了洁净的日子，无论是为男孩是为女孩，她要把一岁的羊羔为燔祭，一只雏鸽或是一只斑鸠为赎罪祭，带到会幕门口交给祭司。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["祭司要献在耶和华面前，为她赎罪，她的血源就洁净了。这条例是为生育的妇人，无论是生男生女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["她的力量若不够献一只羊羔，她就要取两只斑鸠或是两只雏鸽，一只为燔祭，一只为赎罪祭。祭司要为她赎罪，她就洁净了。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/LEV/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/LEV/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/LEV/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}